{"total_count":40,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/56","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/56/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/56/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/56/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/56","id":5937858559,"node_id":"I_kwDOPSiNuM8AAAABYeyH_w","number":56,"title":"No user-facing option to disable in-world container names (global 'Show Container Names' option was removed in v2.5.0)","user":{"login":"castledking","id":69998586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5OTk4NTg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69998586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/castledking","html_url":"https://github.com/castledking","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/castledking/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/castledking/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/castledking/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/castledking/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/castledking/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/castledking/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/castledking/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/castledking/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/castledking/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-20T07:39:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T14:15:26Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T14:15:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\n\nThere's no user-facing way to turn off the container names that are rendered in the world (the label that floats above a container when you look at it), and it looks like one was accidentally lost.\n\nThe translation keys for a **\"Show Container Names\"** option still exist in every locale file:\n\n```json\n\"chesttracker.config.rendering.displayContainerNames\": \"Show Container Names\",\n\"chesttracker.config.rendering.displayContainerNames.description\": \"Whether to show names above containers in the world. This can be overridden per memory bank, under Compatibility.\",\n```\n\n…but no such option exists in the config GUI, and nothing in the codebase references those keys any more — they're orphaned.\n\n## How it happened\n\nThe global option used to exist. It was added in [`dd17271`](https://github.com/ponuing/ChestTracker/commit/dd17271f8fc67fa88915d12a734a0cd3904b6d01) — *\"feat: global toggle for container names; will not apply to existing memory banks\"*:\n\n```java\npublic static class Rendering {\n    @SerialEntry(comment = \"Whether to show names above containers in the world. This can be overridden per memory bank, under Compatibility.\")\n    public boolean displayContainerNames = true;\n    ...\n```\n\nIt was then removed in [`e81f683`](https://github.com/ponuing/ChestTracker/commit/e81f68338461f6171ce5528efe66ee30e1f6d59d) — *\"feat: new name rendering mode: hovered only\"* (2024-09-06), when the per-memory-bank **Container Name Rendering** mode (`FULL` / `HOVERED_ONLY` / `DISABLED`) was introduced under Compatibility. That shipped in **v2.5.0**. The translation keys were left behind by accident.\n\nThe only switch that remains is `debug.disableContainerNames`, which is a DEBUG-level flag (the config file comment literally reads *\"DEBUG: Disable all container names\"*) and is presented as *\"Disable Container Names\"* in the Rendering group — it isn't a reasonable user-facing control for something that used to be a normal option.\n\n## What I'd expect\n\nA **Show Container Names** toggle in `Config → Chest Tracker → Rendering`, defaulting to on, so it can be turned off globally without having to dig through the debug options. The per-memory-bank override under Compatibility should keep working as it does now.\n\n## Affected versions\n\nI only tested on **26.1.2**, so I checked the other maintained branches in code. The same three facts hold on **all** of them:\n\n| Branch | `displayContainerNames` in config | orphaned lang keys | label rendered on hover |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1.21.4 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 1.21.5 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 1.21.6 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 1.21.7 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 1.21.8 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 1.21.9 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 1.21.10 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 1.21.11 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 26.1 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 26.1.1 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 26.1.2 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 26.2 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 26.3 | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |\n\nSo as far as I can tell this isn't version-specific — it's been missing since v2.5.0.\n\n## Proposed patch\n\nRestores the removed option and wires it up. Applies to every branch above with no other changes (the three files are identical across branches for these parts):\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/src/client/java/red/jackf/chesttracker/impl/config/ChestTrackerConfig.java b/src/client/java/red/jackf/chesttracker/impl/config/ChestTrackerConfig.java\n@@\n     public static class Rendering {\n+        @SerialEntry(comment = \"Whether to render names above containers in the world. Can be overridden per memory bank, under Compatibility.\")\n+        public boolean displayContainerNames = true;\n+\n         @SerialEntry(comment = \"Name Render Range. Range: [4, 24] blocks\")\n         public int nameRange = 12;\n     }\ndiff --git a/src/client/java/red/jackf/chesttracker/impl/config/ChestTrackerConfigScreenBuilder.java b/src/client/java/red/jackf/chesttracker/impl/config/ChestTrackerConfigScreenBuilder.java\n@@\n     private static OptionGroup makeRenderingGroup(ConfigClassHandler<ChestTrackerConfig> instance) {\n         return OptionGroup.createBuilder()\n                 .name(translatable(\"chesttracker.config.rendering\"))\n+                .option(Option.<Boolean>createBuilder()\n+                        .name(translatable(\"chesttracker.config.rendering.displayContainerNames\"))\n+                        .description(OptionDescription.of(translatable(\"chesttracker.config.rendering.displayContainerNames.description\")))\n+                        .controller(opt -> BooleanControllerBuilder.create(opt)\n+                                .yesNoFormatter()\n+                                .coloured(true))\n+                        .binding(\n+                                instance.defaults().rendering.displayContainerNames,\n+                                () -> instance.instance().rendering.displayContainerNames,\n+                                b -> instance.instance().rendering.displayContainerNames = b\n+                        ).build())\n                 .option(Option.<Integer>createBuilder()\n                         .name(translatable(\"chesttracker.config.rendering.nameRenderRange\"))\ndiff --git a/src/client/java/red/jackf/chesttracker/impl/rendering/NameRenderer.java b/src/client/java/red/jackf/chesttracker/impl/rendering/NameRenderer.java\n@@\n         if (ChestTrackerConfig.INSTANCE.instance().debug.disableContainerNames) return;\n+        if (!ChestTrackerConfig.INSTANCE.instance().rendering.displayContainerNames) return;\n```\n\nNo new translation strings are needed — the keys are already there in every locale.\n\nI'm happy to open a PR against whichever branches you'd like (or all of them) — the patch is the same everywhere.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/56/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/56/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/55","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/55/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/55/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/55/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/55","id":5908484378,"node_id":"I_kwDOPSiNuM8AAAABYCxRGg","number":55,"title":"Copper chest, and real time update on servers","user":{"login":"dumbling0","id":214653888,"node_id":"U_kgDODMtbwA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214653888?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dumbling0","html_url":"https://github.com/dumbling0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dumbling0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dumbling0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dumbling0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dumbling0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dumbling0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dumbling0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dumbling0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dumbling0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dumbling0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-18T10:15:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T04:25:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The mod doesn't track of items in copper chests.. idk if i'm doing it wrongly but it doesnt work most of the time, and it takes too long to update sometimes","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/55/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/55/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/54","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/54/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/54/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/54/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/54","id":5693378459,"node_id":"I_kwDOPSiNuM8AAAABU1oPmw","number":54,"title":"Ignore or blacklist \"containers\" with certain name, to avoid conflicting with server mods","user":{"login":"victornpb","id":3372598,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzI1OTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3372598?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/victornpb","html_url":"https://github.com/victornpb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victornpb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victornpb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victornpb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victornpb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victornpb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victornpb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victornpb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victornpb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victornpb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":9001279251,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPSiNuM8AAAACGISfEw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-03T20:45:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T12:34:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"So for example on donutsmp.net they have a trading plugin that use the chest interface for interactions, and those aren't real chests. They are getting tracked and assigned to random blocks near you when you use the commands.\n\n<img width=\"461\" height=\"491\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/12fd427c-4e13-4866-ade0-5e59ad6e4024\" />\n\n<img width=\"396\" height=\"468\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eab697a7-ecc1-409a-840c-c03468626ba0\" />\n\nI think one solution would be to allow the user to blacklist some of the names like \n\n/Auction/\n/Quick Buy/\n/Transactions/\n/\\(Page \\d+)/\netc\n\nIt doesnt need to be a regex, a contains string is probably sufficient","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/54/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/54/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/52","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/52/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/52/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/52/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/52","id":5559903044,"node_id":"I_kwDOPSiNuM8AAAABS2VjRA","number":52,"title":"Keep only the unnamed containers","user":{"login":"block13566","id":91778732,"node_id":"U_kgDOBXhurA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91778732?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/block13566","html_url":"https://github.com/block13566","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/block13566/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/block13566/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/block13566/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/block13566/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/block13566/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/block13566/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/block13566/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/block13566/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/block13566/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-23T21:43:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T13:20:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If the container has its name modified on the server side, it will not be recorded. I think this can better prevent unnecessary UI item from being recorded on the server","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/52/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/52/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/51","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/51/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/51/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/51/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ponuing/ChestTracker/issues/51","id":5533748927,"node_id":"I_kwDOPSiNuM8AAAABSdZOvw","number":51,"title":"26.2 crash","user":{"login":"Washyshade","id":299568535,"node_id":"U_kgDOEdsNlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/299568535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Washyshade","html_url":"https://github.com/Washyshade","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Washyshade/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Washyshade/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Washyshade/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Washyshade/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Washyshade/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Washyshade/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Washyshade/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Washyshade/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Washyshade/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":9001279259,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPSiNuM8AAA